 { Stronger side's king on one side of the pawnsIf the stronger side's king only manages to stand on one side of the promotion squares and the other king supports his pawns, things are more complicated. Here White needs to exploit zugzwang themes on many occasions. First, a waiting move. } 1. Ra1 $1 Kc3 2. Ke3 Kc2 3. Rh1 { Zugzwang again. } Kc3 4. Rc1+ Kb2 5. Kd2 $18 { And the pawns are captured. Things change if we move the position more than one file to the left. } 
